**Full locked pipeline:**
```
upload → create_run → ingest_pdf → parse_ocr(Docling) → clause_index 
  → [Harvey branch: load prior versions | Kira branch: load playbook + compliance rules] (parallel)
  → 3 Harvey reviewers (parallel, blinded) → harvey_validator
