  → admin_merge → 3 final reviewers (parallel) → agreement check
    → agree: → awaiting_human_approval → verdict
    → disagree round 1: → admin delta → re-review disputed only
    → disagree round 2: → admin tie-break (unresolved_by_consensus) → awaiting_human_approval → verdict
```

**Everything else Codex specified — I agree:**
