```
finding_id, branch, round, reviewer_id, clause_id, page, source_span, 
severity(critical/high/medium/low), issue_type(liability_exposure/open_clause/
non_compliant/weakened_term/missing_clause/ambiguous), rationale, 
recommendation, confidence, consensus_status(agreed/disputed/unresolved)
```

